y information about the state law or the number of casinos each organization operates.\n\nC) Apex will use funds it obtains from the sale of the five casinos to help fund its acquisition of the Eldorado chain.\n- This statement suggests that Apex has the financial resources to acquire the Eldorado chain, which could potentially undermine the prediction. However, it does not provide any information about the state law or the number of casinos each organization operates.\n\nD) Some of the state's counties do not permit casinos.\n- This statement suggests that there are counties in the state where casinos are not allowed, which could potentially limit Apex's ability to acquire additional casinos without violating the state law. This directly addresses the issue of Apex acquiring the Eldorado chain and could undermine the prediction. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
