les department.\n- This option describes a situation where Li signs a house sales contract based on relevant national and regulations of law. While this involves following the law, it does not necessarily involve applying the law in a judicial context.\n\nD) The public security bureau director convenes the working meeting for improving the quality of police handling cases.\n- This option describes a meeting to discuss improving the quality of police handling cases, which does not involve applying the law. It seems more like a discussion or planning meeting rather than the application of the law. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
