en before. Therefore, my final option is:  D\n- This option provides support for the argument that the high success rate is indicative of good fund-raising efforts, as it implies that the fund-raisers were successful in their contacts with potential donors who had never given before, which may be a sign of good fund-raising efforts.\n</think>\n<answer>\nA\n</answer>",
