messages:   55%|#####5    | 330/600 [10:51<10:11,  2.26s/it][['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nIn most cases, writing poems and filling words is a process of mutual accommodation between language and emotion. It is unpredictable for a beginner to have what kind of feelings and choose what kind of sentence pattern to start with. But once he has a preliminary idea, he can always get appropriate help in the book Tang and Song Poetry Rhythms. He will know which words are suitable to express what kind of feelings, what kind of rhyme he should choose, and how to make rational use of certain rhetorical devices so as not to be fooled in the face of special syntax. If you have read enough ancient poems and have a certain sense of language, you will indeed be able to complete your first creation with the help of this book. It can not teach people to write amazing masterpieces, but with the greatest sincerity to prevent you from making all kinds of jokes.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the followings is the main content of this text?\n# Options:\nA) Tang and song poetry rhythms is suitable for beginners because of its rich tones\nB) Poetry creation is essentially a process of mutual accommodation between language and emotion\nC) Tang and song poetry rhythms provides a very good help for beginners\nD) The creator of poetry must have abundant emotion and high literary accomplishment', "<think>.\nTo determine the main content of the text, let's analyze the key points mentioned:.\n\n1. Writing poems involves a process of mutual accommodation between language and emotion.\n2. Beginners may struggle with choosing appropriate words and sentence patterns.\n3. Tang and Song Poetry Rhythms offers guidance on selecting suitable words, choosing appropriate rhymes, and using rhetorical devices.\n4. The book aims to prevent beginners from making mistakes rather than teaching them to create masterpieces.\n5. The text emphasizes the importance of reading enough ancient poems and having a sense of language.\n\nBased on these points, the main content of the text is that Tang and Song Poetry Rhythms provides a helpful resource for beginners in poetry creation, focusing on mutual accommodation between language and emotion, and offering guidance on selecting suitable words, choosing appropriate rhymes, and using rhetorical devices. Therefore, the correct answer is:. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
