rch engines, which implies a reliance on external sources rather than developing their own understanding.\n   - **B) Ability to learn by analogy**: This option implies that Pancake Man can understand new concepts by comparing them to existing knowledge. The context does not provide any information about their ability to learn by analogy. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
