n by B is \\( \\frac{T}{2v_w} + \\frac{T}{2v_r} = T \\).\n\n6. **Comparing the times:**.\n   - Since both A and B take the same total time \\( T \\), and they walk/run at the same speeds, the times taken by A and B to cover the same distance are equal.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is:. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
