s. However, it does not provide any information about the impact of financing channels on the success of startups. Thus, it does not weaken the statement.\n\nC) Venture capitalists are more sensitive to changes in the financial needs of startups than other investors.\nThis option implies that venture capitalists are better equipped to handle the financial challenges of startups. If this is true, it suggests that venture capital financing may be more effective in supporting the growth and success of startups. This would weaken the statement that financing channels are more important factors for the successful development of a new company than other factors. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
