messages:   90%|######### | 541/600 [23:00<00:41,  1.43it/s][["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nOn the issue of the selection of the head of the personnel section, a bureau decided to vote by all the staff of the unit. The top three candidates were candidates. Each person only needed to tick the list of employees of the Bureau. The vote counting team found that Zhang Hao, who had just graduated, did not tick anyone; Wang Ming checked all those who checked Zhao Jie; Li Zilu ticked all those who didn't get the full vote\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, from this it follows that:\n# Options:\nA) Wang ming and li zilu didn't tick each other\nB) Wang ming and li zilu tick each other\nC) Wang ming chose li zilu, but li zilu didn't choose wang ming\nD) Wang ming didn't choose li zilu, but li zilu chose wang ming", "<think>.\nTo solve this problem, let's break down the information given and analyze it step by step:.\n\n1. **Zhang Hao did not tick anyone**: This means Zhang Hao did not vote for any of the candidates.\n2. **Wang Ming checked all those who checked Zhao Jie**: This implies that Wang Ming voted for everyone who voted for Zhao Jie.\n3. **Li Zilu ticked all those who didn't get the full vote**: This means Li Zilu voted for everyone who did not receive a full vote (i.e., someone who did not vote for everyone else).\n\nNow, let's consider the implications of these statements:.\n\n- Since Zhang Hao did not vote for anyone, he cannot be a candidate.\n- Wang Ming voted for everyone who voted for Zhao Jie. If Zhao Jie received a full vote, then Wang Ming would have voted for everyone else. However, since Li Zilu voted for everyone who did not get a full vote, Zhao Jie must have received a full vote. Therefore, Wang Ming voted for everyone except Li Zilu.\n- Li Zilu voted for everyone who did not get a full vote. Since Zhao Jie received a full vote, Li Zilu voted for everyone else.\n\nFrom this analysis, we can conclude that:.\n\n- Wang Ming voted for everyone except Li Zilu.\n- Li Zilu voted for everyone except Zhao Jie.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is:. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
