als.\n   - **Option B**: "Chinese people live in an interconnected world" - While this statement is true, it does not capture the depth of the relationship between individuals and their social networks as described in the context.\n   - **Option C**: "China\'s potential private resources" - This option is not directly related to the context, which focuses on social networks rather than private resources.\n   - **Option D**: "The development basis of Chinese associations" - This option is too specific and does not encompass the broader theme of social networks as presented in the context.\n\n5. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
