emperature). Therefore, it is an environmental effect.\n\nD) A coastal city reclaimed the sea to build an island, and a small town with a capacity of 70,000 people was built on the island.\n- This option describes a situation where human activities (reclamation of sea) have caused environmental changes (new island and town). However, it does not mention any specific environmental effects. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
