 it doesn't directly explain the environmental costs or impacts mentioned in the paragraph.\n\nC) Bottleneck in the development of animal husbandry: This option doesn't seem to fit the context, as it doesn't mention any specific bottlenecks or limitations in the development of animal husbandry. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
