ement "the more technologically advanced a society is, the more aware its members are of technology\'s drawbacks" fits into the argument.\n\n3. **Option A Analysis**: This option suggests that the statement is offered as an explanation for why people\'s resistance to technological innovations is more pronounced in advanced societies. This aligns with the sociologist\'s argument that advanced societies are more aware of the drawbacks, leading to greater resistance.\n\n4. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
