n global development and human affairs.\n5. The text quotes a report from the World Commission on Culture and Development, which states that culture is the ultimate goal and destination of the overall prosperity and development of human existence.\n6. The text concludes by stating that culture is the ultimate goal and destination of the overall prosperity and development of human existence.\n\nBased on this analysis, the main content of the text is that culture is the ultimate goal and destination of the overall prosperity and development of human existence. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
